WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
A furious blond chef holds a magenta instant-noodle cup and fork.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.450
He tastes one noodle and recoils in disgust.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.850
His next fork gesture sends a long noodle whip across the kitchen.

4
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.700
The noodles coil into an enormous tangled knot.

5
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.400
The chef inspects the aftermath with complete disapproval.

6
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.800
After all that destruction, he still refuses the dinner.
